// The six providers under study (E1-1). Extended additively: no existing value
// moves. Every exhaustive match over this enum is a compile-time obligation on
// purpose -- a provider that arrives without its accounting convention, its
// credential mapping or its adapter must not compile, because each of those
// silently defaulted is a wrong number rather than a missing one.
