	// wave, so the arm lands with it — an id that names nothing was the whole
	// reason to wait, and it now names something.
	//
	// Scoped by the agent run's CANONICAL id; a stale id resolves through the
	// grouping redirect rather than answering `NOT_FOUND`. The graph is built
	// over the run's member traces through the same trace arm above, so a run of
	// one trace and that trace itself produce the same evidence.
